                    <death when="1859-04-13"/>
                    <occupation>novelist</occupation>
                    <occupation/>
                    <note type="editorial"> See <title>DNB</title>. <p>Lady Sydney Morgan was an Irish novelist of a
      nationalistic bent. She married <persName key="MOR09">Sir Thomas Charles Morgan</persName> who
      also appears in the diary.</p><p>Published a series of popular works including the <title>The Wild Irish Girl</title> (1806).
      She was the daughter of a Dublin theatre manager, and married Sir Thomas Morgan (1780-1843).
      Godwin notes Owenson in his 1796 list.</p></note>
